{"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems"]]},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ForwardEvents\/init(to:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ForwardEvents\/access"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ForwardEvents\/run(in:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ForwardEvents\/System-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","generated":true}],"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/UpdateEvents","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ForwardChanges"],"anchor":"Built-In-Systems","title":"Built-In Systems","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ForwardEvents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"E","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"E","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Event","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Event","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule5EventP"}]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/DrivingAWorldFromAnApp"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this system to hand events to code that doesn’t run in a schedule, such as a task that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"plays a sound for e